1
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:09,040
YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!

2
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,578
You're on the move!

3
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:09,797
there better be a bathroom in that palace
let's focus on getting in first did you

4
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:13,557
forget what happened last time how was i
supposed to know we couldn't walk through

5
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:16,937
doors hold on guys maybe this time we

6
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:20,717
can pharaoh i know why we were sent here

7
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:25,337
we have to find out what your name is in
in order to beat Bakura at his own game.

8
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:27,320
Now, please, let us in.

9
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,300
It worked!

10
00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:34,080
We can go through! It worked! What?

11
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:35,740
You sure?

12
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:37,560
Oh, happy day!

13
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,480
This place is known for
its delectable food.

14
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:44,360
Bopas is going to eat a
five-course meal. Come on!

15
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,437
Let's get in there and start
hunting for clues, Cal!

16
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,350
Yeah!

17
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,480
Childless pork chops, here I come!

18
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,080
This is some crit.

19
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:05,720
It's good to be the king. Focus, Joey.

20
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,294
We have to find clues.

21
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:08,937
Bobasa will check the kitchen.

22
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:10,961
Let's meet back here in one hour.

23
00:02:11,220 --> 00:02:12,300
Good call, Yuke.

24
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:21,657
This is not over.

25
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:24,217
Your empire shall crumble, Pharaoh.

26
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:28,957
Your millennium items will be mine,
and Zork the Dark One will return.

27
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,280
Mark my words.

28
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,680
I'm afraid it's all over, Bakura.

29
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,960
Your plans for destruction
will never come to pass.

30
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:40,100
So let it be written, so let it be done.

31
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:43,340
The land of Egypt shall
once again know peace.

32
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:46,410
Never.

33
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:51,460
That's enough.

34
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,720
Now return those items to me.

35
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:56,500
Those items will stay
right where they are.

36
00:02:57,700 --> 00:03:00,060
Akhnad, what is the meaning of this?

37
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,670
Pharaoh,

38
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:07,277
I am responsible for the creation of
the items and I shall decide their fate.

39
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,190
Oh, no.

40
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,460
He holds the key.

41
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:15,300
That item belongs to Shadda.

42
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:17,017
What have you done with him?

43
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:21,700
What's important is that his Millennium
Item will be put to good use,

44
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:23,340
as will all of yours.

45
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:24,920
You've lost your mind!

46
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:28,580
Look at Vakura!

47
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,917
Where am I?

48
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,700
Who are you? Tell me! My hands!

49
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:40,680
What's happening to me?

50
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:46,220
I was just using that fool as my pawn!

51
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,680
Who are you?

52
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,840
The shadows are taking me!

53
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,540
Someone help me!

54
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,820
He's gone!

55
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:02,920
It's time you learned the true
nature of this shadow game!

56
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,300
Explain yourself!

57
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,250
Pharoah!

58
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:09,900
You must stop him!

59
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,350
Shaddaa!

60
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:17,982
Oh, here we go.

61
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:19,594
This could be a start.

62
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:22,820
Maybe the Pharaoh's name
is somewhere on this wall.

63
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:27,915
Of course, it would help if I could
actually read ancient hieroglyphics.

64
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:34,940
Excuse me, ma 'am.

65
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,017
Can I ask you a question?

66
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:36,930
Hello?

67
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,277
Oh, not again.

68
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,360
That's not cool.

69
00:04:42,660 --> 00:04:45,072
These people treat me like I don't exist.

70
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:48,800
I may have just hit the jackpot.

71
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:51,960
It's like the palace library or something.

72
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:55,220
Oh, this is just great.

73
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:59,580
We'll never find that name.

74
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:04,560
Searching for clues.

75
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,640
Never tasted it.

76
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,960
So good.

77
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:11,560
That's right, my young friend.

78
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,360
Find me that name.

79
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,440
He he he he he!

80
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,230
Shadda!

81
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,620
Careful, Pharaoh!

82
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,820
Aknadin is a traitor!

83
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:24,120
Now give me back my Millennium Key!

84
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,720
Release me!

85
00:05:27,540 --> 00:05:28,370
Shadda!

86
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,700
Anyone else?

87
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:32,900
Aknadin, what is the meaning of all this?

88
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,520
Have you gone mad?

89
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:38,540
I don't know who's controlling
your mind, but this ends now!

90
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,957
A new king shall soon rise!

91
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,500
Hold your tongue!

92
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:45,240
How dare you utter such venomous words,

93
00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:48,302
and in the presence of
the great pharaoh no less!

94
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,510
Silence!

95
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:52,010
No!

96
00:05:52,093 --> 00:05:53,389
What have you done to him?

97
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:55,540
Sato can't move!

98
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,357
It's almost like he's...

99
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,420
Frozen in time? Why, yes!

100
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,220
Just like this!

101
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,757
That ought to hold you for a while.

102
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:09,700
At least long enough for me to
complete what Bakura couldn't.

103
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:15,080
I've done it!

104
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:19,574
As soon as I place the seven items in
the stone, the Dark One shall rise!

105
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:22,780
And together we shall usher in a new age!

106
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:25,460
And your empire shall crumble.

107
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:29,260
It all comes full circle, doesn't it?

108
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:32,949
For now I shall return the seven
treasures whence they came.

109
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,040
This necklace is number six.

110
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:39,577
And now, the final piece!

111
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,540
Release my Millennium Eye!

112
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,740
Now to finish what I began years ago!

113
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,290
That's right!

114
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:53,760
Restore the Seven Treasures
to their resting place!

115
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:58,416
I thought Bakuro was defeated, but
then how can I be hearing his voice?

116
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:02,289
You've proven yourself
to be a worthy pawn!

117
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:08,000
Now complete your task, and my ultimate
shadow game shall be nearly complete!

118
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:16,820
I saw Bakura disappear into
the shadows with my own eyes.

119
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:23,120
His so-called shadow game should be over.

120
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:25,037
Wait, unless...

121
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,620
The final piece.

122
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:32,280
Is this all just a game?

123
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:45,020
Leave it to you to sleep through the most
important game of your life, Pharaoh.

124
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:47,760
Where are we? Tell me!

125
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:52,820
Why, we're in the Shadow Realm, of
course, sitting before the playing field.

126
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:56,640
After all, I promised you
a Shadow Game, didn't I?

127
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,760
I always trooped my word.

128
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:02,020
I'm in no mood for games! Too late.

129
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:05,007
I'm afraid you're right
in the middle of one.

130
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,697
The field is the world of ancient Egypt.

131
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:10,600
The pawns are the people of your past.

132
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:15,860
Are you saying that everything we do
affects the events of the past? Are you?

133
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:20,295
Just when I think you can't sink any
lower, you proved me wrong, Pakura.

134
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:25,251
Manipulating the lives of others just
so you can play out some twisted game?

135
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,100
Not some game, the game.

136
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:32,100
And as soon as I resurrect
Zork from the Millennium Stu,

137
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:34,780
the final stage of this game will begin.

138
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:42,700
Wait, so if I don't defeat Sork,
that means I lose the game?

139
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,640
You'll lose much more
than that. Like what?

140
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,680
Like those meddling
twits you call friends.

141
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,748
They enter a world where
they didn't belong.

142
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:56,056
So when the playing field disappears,
they'll be trapped in the shadow.

143
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,680
You'll never see them again!

144
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:06,740
If you want to save your friends,
you'll have to win the game.

145
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:10,888
However, at the moment, all of
your pawns are frozen in time,

146
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:13,800
thanks to this handy device. What's that?

147
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:17,160
Why, it's my hourglass token, of course.

148
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:20,440
Your hourglass token? Exactly.

149
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:23,597
And as the game master,
I possess three of them.

150
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:27,800
This one freezes time for every
character in the game except for mine.

151
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:30,420
So you can manipulate time?

152
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:31,900
That's right.

153
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,577
And it's not the first time.

154
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:34,860
Observe.

155
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:37,800
I used this one earlier in the game.

156
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:42,257
Perhaps you recall a little incident
during which time went in reverse?

157
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,620
Now you know how!

158
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:02,097
So that was you!

159
00:10:02,180 --> 00:10:06,437
guilty as charged and he who
controls the hands of time

160
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:11,137
controls fate thanks to these
hour classes I can rewrite history

161
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:15,497
and not only once but three
times over the course of the game

162
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:20,920
you know what that means right
your life is under my control

163
00:10:27,260 --> 00:10:30,020
something's not right
I can't move a muscle

164
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:35,168
Vakura must be behind this.

165
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:37,498
I just hope the pharaoh's all right.

166
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:42,102
I could think of worse
situations to be stuck in.

167
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,240
You're my pawn now.

168
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:48,140
So you're free to move about.

169
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:51,940
What puzzles me is why
that buffoon is unaffected.

170
00:10:53,940 --> 00:10:55,040
This is bad.

171
00:10:55,300 --> 00:10:57,557
My belly is so big I
can't see my slippers.

172
00:10:57,640 --> 00:11:00,200
Master Zork, hear me!

173
00:11:00,460 --> 00:11:02,920
I now offer you the seven treasures!

174
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:08,540
I sense the pulse of pure
evil beating below us.

175
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:11,020
The Dark One has awakened.

176
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:18,140
So, the mortal responsible for creating
the Millennium Items has returned.

177
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:23,297
Now, denounce your allegiance to
Egypt and pledge your loyalty to me.

178
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:27,120
Do this, and everything
you desire shall be yours.

179
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:31,000
My only wish is for a
new pharaoh to be named.

180
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:35,080
He shall be my own beloved son, Sato!

181
00:11:36,660 --> 00:11:39,400
No, this cannot be true.

182
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:42,860
Master Arknadin is my father?

183
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:45,320
Very well.

184
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:51,260
Your transformation from Sacred Godhead
to Lord of Darkness is now complete.

185
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:57,480
No, Akhenaten!

186
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:08,620
My Akhenaten game piece has just
doubled in overall strength.

187
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,060
I give you the great Shadow Magus.

188
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,260
What have you done to Akhenaten?

189
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,260
I haven't done a thing.

190
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:22,337
All of these events are reoccurring
exactly as they did 5,000 years ago.

191
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:25,460
With some small modifications, of course.

192
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:30,160
Thanks to this shadow game of mine,
I'm able to influence certain events.

193
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:31,860
You see, Pharaoh,

194
00:12:32,340 --> 00:12:33,170
in the old days,

195
00:12:33,253 --> 00:12:37,640
you managed to lock away your own
spirit in order to seal Zork away.

196
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:40,520
But you won't be so lucky this time.

197
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:43,077
There are still some holes in your memory.

198
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:46,777
I mean, let's face it, Pharaoh,
you don't even know your own name.

199
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:51,820
A single word with the power to both
resurrect Zork and lock him away.

200
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:53,810
However,

201
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:57,397
I discovered a way to bring back
the Dark One without that word,

202
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,980
by simply using this,

203
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:01,740
my third and final hourglass.

204
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,920
Oh no, just what are you saying, Bakura?

205
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:07,180
Let me spell this out for you.

206
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:12,280
When the last grain of sand falls, the
ruler of the darkest shadows shall arise.

207
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:22,341
The pharaoh's name should
be located in this room.

208
00:13:22,580 --> 00:13:26,020
Now find it before the
others do and destroy it.

209
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:30,360
Every pharaoh in history
must be listed here.

210
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:35,147
So the name I'm looking for has got to
be written somewhere on the last tablet.

211
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,230
What?

212
00:13:36,313 --> 00:13:38,060
This doesn't make any sense at all.

213
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:41,760
This stone tablet is completely blank!

214
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:47,680
Now, great Shadow Makers, banish
the pharaoh to the darkness,

215
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:50,280
so that your son may take the throne.

216
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:57,780
This is what I have always wanted for you,
Shadow, ever since you were a young boy.

217
00:13:58,660 --> 00:14:02,580
For your own protection, no one
must ever know I have a family.

218
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:07,940
How could he leave me and then
lie to me all these years?

219
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:11,357
There's something else
you should know, my son.

220
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:14,440
The former king Ahnam
Cannon was my brother.

221
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,977
That means should anything
happen to the current pharaoh,

222
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:20,589
you are next in line
to inherit the throne.

223
00:14:21,180 --> 00:14:26,120
Why, after all these years of loyalty,
would he turn on his own family?

224
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:29,837
Bakura must have preyed
upon the hidden jealousy

225
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:32,332
of Narin always felt towards his brother.

226
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:37,033
And the incredible guilt he must have
harbored after giving up his family.

227
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:44,580
Sato, my boy, no longer shall we
live in the shadow of my brother!

228
00:14:45,100 --> 00:14:50,877
The time has come to rise up and claim
our rightful place on the throne of Egypt!

229
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:53,060
Heed my words!

230
00:14:53,460 --> 00:14:55,220
The era of King Seto!

231
00:14:55,380 --> 00:14:56,340
I strayed down!

232
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:02,440
Farewell, Pharaoh!

233
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,980
Someone is deflecting the attack! But who?

234
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,607
This isn't part of the game?

235
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,440
Who has interfered?

236
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:26,820
Did you forget?

237
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:31,640
There are two people playing this
game, and I have a token as well.

238
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,673
Where did you get that?

239
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:39,477
Who dares stand in the way of my destiny?

240
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:40,660
Identify yourself!

241
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:44,560
I am Hassan, protector of the pharaohs.

242
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:48,220
For centuries I have defended
the honor of Egypt's kings.

243
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:50,568
So fear not, your highness.

244
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:52,936
I shall shield you from the darkness.

245
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:57,000
Just as I shielded your
father and his father before.

246
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,840
Hello? Who's there?

247
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:06,100
I have come to warn you of
an impending danger, Pharaoh.

248
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:09,120
Zork the Dark One will soon awaken.

249
00:16:11,460 --> 00:16:12,640
I remember him.

250
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:15,317
He came to me in a vision
when I was stranded.

251
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,694
But I thought I was just hallucinating.

252
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:21,680
If you truly are the
protector of the pharaoh,

253
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:24,740
then you should be
protecting my son, Seto,

254
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:29,640
for he is the true king of Egypt, not
that imposter cowering behind you.

255
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:32,180
Darkness be gone!

256
00:16:34,980 --> 00:16:35,810
No!

257
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:44,720
My time freezing hourglass!

258
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:48,960
Oh, well, it seems time marches on.

259
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:51,440
My friends are now free!

260
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:54,960
I can move!

261
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:56,390
What?

262
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:58,540
But I rendered those fools immovable!

263
00:16:58,860 --> 00:17:01,213
They were prisoners in their own bodies!

264
00:17:02,420 --> 00:17:03,250
Not anymore.

265
00:17:03,333 --> 00:17:05,520
Your shadow spell has been broken!

266
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:11,957
It's only a matter of time before the
shadows claim your spirit, Pharaoh!

267
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:15,400
Oh, and everything you've
ever cared about crumbles.

268
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:19,060
Your poor friends are
all running out of steam.

269
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,420
What? But how?

270
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:26,748
Attached to everyone's dual discs is a
sensor that measures their life energy.

271
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:30,120
My great shadow Magus is at full power.

272
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:33,640
But the same cannot be
set for your friends.

273
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:40,977
I'm afraid once an individual's
life force sensor goes dark,

274
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:44,600
The spirit is banished to the
Shadow Realm for all eternity.

275
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:46,840
That goes for you, too.

276
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:50,540
When you lose in the past,
you lose here as well.

277
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,160
Now then,

278
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:57,917
are you beginning to understand the
brilliance of this Shadow Game I've created?

279
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:00,060
You and I are the Game Masters,

280
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:04,860
manipulating the fate of people who
lived on this Earth 5,000 years ago.

281
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:09,477
At times, we're merely observing events
exactly as they were played out in the past.

282
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:11,325
Most other times we intervene,

283
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:15,814
manipulating certain actions in order
to change the outcome in our favor.

284
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:17,240
So you might say,

285
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:19,715
we're like two sides of the same coin,

286
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:23,637
and we're playing out the ultimate
battle between light and shadows.

287
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:25,680
But Korra, this must end!

288
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:29,480
Of course, every game has an end, Farrell.

289
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:32,597
It's just a question of
who the victor will be,

290
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:35,798
and who will spend eternity
roaming the Shadow Realm.

291
00:18:35,980 --> 00:18:38,577
Now do you see why I called
this the ultimate game?

292
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:44,200
Here we both sit, high above the rest of
the world, deciding the future of mankind.

293
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:47,860
The fate of the world rests in our hands!

294
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:52,220
That's enough!

295
00:18:52,580 --> 00:18:56,580
You may fight for greed, but I
fight for something else entirely.

296
00:18:57,300 --> 00:19:00,800
The safety of my friends
and that of the world.

297
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:03,620
I defeated you once and I'll do it again!

298
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,917
That's all in the past, Pharah.

299
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,800
But here in this shadow game,

300
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:11,697
I have all sorts of advantages I
didn't have in our first encounter.

301
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:16,280
And since your memory is sketchy at
best, you'll never remember how you won.

302
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,660
I still have time.

303
00:19:21,940 --> 00:19:23,469
That's where you're wrong.

304
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:28,380
Time is one luxury you don't have, for
the countdown to destruction has begun.
